          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.25.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 25:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omu igyesha ry'engano Reubeeni yaaza omu ishwa, yaagwa aha madudaimu, yaagareetera Lea nyina. Rakeeli yaashaba Lea ati: Ninkweshengyereza, mpa aha madudaimu ga mutabani waawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lea yaamugarukamu ati: Iwe okyetsire ekigambo kikye okuncwa aha mushaija wange; mbwenu nooyenda kutwara n'amadudaimu g'omwana wangye? Rakeeli yaagira ati: Mbwenu ku orampe amadudaimu g'omwana waawe, baro naija kukuraarira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwabazyo Yakobo ku yaabaire naaruga omu ishwa naataaha, Lea yaashohora kumubugana, yaamugira ati: Oshemereire kundaarira, ahabw'okuba naaha amadudaimu g'omwana wangye ahabwawe. Yakobo nikwo kumuraarira ekyo kiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga yaahurira okushaba kwa Lea, yaagira enda, yaazaarira Yakobo omojo wa kataano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lea yaagira ati: Ruhanga yampa ebihembo, ahakuba nkaha ibanye omuzaana wangye; ogwo mwana yaamweta Isakaari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lea yaagaruka yaagira enda, yaazaarira Yakobo omwojo wa mukaaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lea yaagira ati: Ruhanga yampa ekiconco kirungi eky'obugore; mbwenu ibanye naija kuguma naanye, ahakuba mmuzaariire aboojo mukaaga; omwana yaamweta Zebuluuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima yaazaara omwishiki, yaamweta Dina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
