              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 61:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Labaani yaamugarukamu ati: Ku oraabe nongirira embabazi, ogume aha; ahakuba nyetegyereize ku MUKAMA ampaire omugisha ahabwawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.29.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 29:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaagaruka yaagira ati: Oncwere ebihembo ebi orikwenda, niinyija kubikuha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.31.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 31:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.24.45"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 24:45",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yakobo yaamugarukamu ati: Noomanya oku naakukoreire, n'oku amatungo gaawe gaabaire, obu naabaire ninkigariisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahakuba agu waabaire oine ntakaizire, gakaba gari makye; mbwenu gakanyire, gaaba maingi munonga; kandi MUKAMA akakuha omugisha, ahu naabaire nza hoona. Mbwenu nyowe ndyatunga ryari eby'okukwatsa eka yangye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onu ati: Mbwenu nkuhe ki? Yakobo yaagarukamu ati: Toine ki orampe; kureka ku oraabe noikiriza kunkorera eki, niinyija kugumizamu kuriisa amasyo gaawe n'okugarinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyikirize ndabe omu busyo bwawe bwona eri izooba, nyihemu entaama zoona ez'ebigabo n'ez'amayenje, n'abaana baazo abarikwiragura, n'embuzi z'obugondo n'ez'ebitanga; ezirikushusha zityo nizo ziriba ebihembo byangye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.37.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 37:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima ku oraije kureeba ebihembo byangye, amazima gangye nigaija kweyoreka; embuzi yoona ei oraashangye etari y'ebitanga nari ey'obugondo, n'entaama yoona etari erikwiragura, biri n'enyibano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labaani yaagira ati: Ni kirungi; ka kibe nk'oku waagamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eryo izooba Labaani yaashorooramu empaya z'embuzi ez'ebihuuga n'ez'obugondo n'ebuguma zoona ez'ebitanga n'ez'obugondo n'eine ekigabo yoona, n'entaama ezirikwiragura zoona, yaaziha abatabani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaatsiga ahagati ye na Yakobo omwanya gw'orugyendo rw'ebiro bishatu. Yakobo yaariisa amasyo ga Labaani agaatsigaraho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo yaatwara enkoni z'emilebeni mibisi, n'ez'emiluzi, n'ez'arumoni, yaazicwamu amabara agarikwera maraingwa, gaareebeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaazita omu mikura erikutwara amaizi omu bwato, ahu amasyo ganywera; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku gaabaire gaija kunywa, ezirikwenda kwema zaayema nizireeba ezo nkoni, zizaara ez'ebihuuga n'ez'ebigabo n'ez'amayenje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo yaashoroora abo baana b'entaama, kandi amasyo yaagareebesa ez'ebihuuga n'ezirikwiragura zoona eziri omu busyo bwa Labaani; bwanyima eze yaazita aha kwazo, yaareka kuziteerana n'obusyo bwa Labaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enungi ku zaabaire ziba nizeema, Yakobo ata enkoni omu mikura omu maisho gaazo, ngu zeemere ahagati y'ezo nkoni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwonka ku zaabaire ziba ziri mbi, areka kutaho enkoni; n'ahabw'ekyo embi ziri eza Labaani, enungi ziba eza Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwo nikwo ogwo mushaija yaayeyongyeire kutunga munonga, n'okugira amasyo maingi, abazaana n'abahuuku, engamira n'endogoya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
